WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.781
Day 1. Which Letters Are Known?.

2
00:00:02.231 --> 00:00:07.218
Day one is a check, not a lesson. It shows which letters your child already knows.

3
00:00:07.818 --> 00:00:12.050
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the big letters.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.839
Point to each letter and ask: what is this letter? Mark each one named right.

5
00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:22.075
Saying the sound instead of the name is a good sign. But only the name counts today.

6
00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:29.557
Do not teach, and do not correct. Then read the box at the bottom of your page, and stop at the first line that fits.

7
00:00:30.007 --> 00:00:33.286
Write the two numbers down, and keep the page for day ten.
